<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},
<p>Thank you for getting in touch with the Qantas Customer Care team. I'm sorry to hear <em><strong>&lt;insert complaint or issue / suggestion&gt;</strong></em>.<br />
<br />
<strong>Your inflight meal</strong><br />
<br />
We always strive to offer all our customers an enjoyable inflight meal. That’s why on top of our standard meals, we also offer a selection of special menus to cater for specific dietary requirements.<br />
<br />
Our special meals list is based on one drawn up by the International Air Transport Association and agreed by major airlines across the world.<br />
<br />
While our special meals list doesn’t include a meal specifically for customers who <em><strong>specify their needs etc</strong></em>, we always try to cover the most common dietary requirements.<br />
<br />
<em><strong>If suggesting meal add</strong></em><br />
<br />
We do have a <em><strong>SPECIFY MEAL</strong></em> which does not include <em><strong>list details</strong></em>. And of course, you are also welcome to bring your own food on board the flight.<br />
<br />
<strong><em>If haven’t specified what they can/can’t eat add</em></strong><br />
<br />
If you’d like to contact us call 13 13 13, we’d be happy to talk you through what is and isn’t included in each meal to see which option best meets your needs.<br />
<br />
You’re also welcome to bring your own food on board the flight.<br />
<br />
<strong>We value your opinion</strong><br />
<br />
Customer feedback is extremely important to us so that we can provide you with exceptional service each time you fly with Qantas.<br />
<br />
Thank you for taking the time to tell us about your experience and we look forward to welcoming you onboard again soon.</p>
</body>
</html>